# The 1.0 CLI links removed 0.x spellings to https://smithers.sh/migration/1.0#<anchor>
# (packages/smithers/src/Unsupported.ts). A 301 keeps the fragment; an Astro
# redirect page (meta refresh) drops it, so this file is the redirect.
/migration/1.0  /docs/migration/1.0/  301
/migration/1.0/  /docs/migration/1.0/  301

# Vocs-era routes that ship inside published packages.
#
# Package JSDoc points at https://smithers.sh/api/<pkg> and
# https://smithers.sh/concepts/<x>. Those were real routes on the old vocs
# site; the Starlight site serves the same material under /docs/, so every one
# of them 404s today. About a hundred of these links are compiled into the
# .d.ts files of already-published packages, where they cannot be edited, so
# the fix has to live here rather than in the sources. Fixing the sources as
# well is still worth doing; it just cannot repair what npm already holds.
#
# A 301 keeps the fragment, so /api/patterns#identity-and-ownership still lands
# on that heading.
#
# Order matters: the first match wins, so the two /api/ spellings that are not
# package slugs are listed before the splat that would otherwise swallow them.
# Both name pages of @smthrs/patterns' own site rather than the aggregate
# reference, because that is where teams and loops are documented.
/api/patterns-teams  https://patterns.smithers.sh/teams/  301
/api/patterns-loops  https://patterns.smithers.sh/loops/  301
/api/*  /docs/reference/api/:splat/  301

# The concept pages were renamed rather than moved, so the specific spellings
# come first; the splat below catches the ones that only moved under /docs/.
# "step keys" is now content addressing, and "failure and retry" is retries.
/concepts/step-keys  /docs/concepts/content-addressing/  301
/concepts/failure-and-retry  /docs/concepts/retries/  301
# The journal's concurrency and journal material is no longer on smithers.sh at
# all: it lives on the package's own site, where the owner fence is the page
# that answers what /concepts/concurrency used to.
/concepts/journal  https://journal.smithers.sh/  301
/concepts/concurrency  https://journal.smithers.sh/concepts/owner-fence/  301
/concepts/*  /docs/concepts/:splat/  301

/integrations/mcp-server  https://mcp.smithers.sh/  301
/reference/errors  /docs/reference/errors/  301
/reference/*  /docs/reference/:splat/  301
